      "He later became the second President of Somalia from 1967 until his assassination in 1969.",
      "Sharmarke succeeded Abdullahi Issa Mohamud, who led the government during the Italian trusteeship from 1956 to 1960.",
      "His legacy is significant for the Somali diaspora as a symbol of early democratic governance before decades of military rule."
